                  "fill": "$ink-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 720,
                  "content": "A collision moves energy through the vehicle. What shows on the outside is the beginning of the inspection, not the conclusion of it. Every vehicle that arrives at Trends is inspected in person, photographed, and where necessary partially disassembled before a repair plan is written.",
