                  "fill": "$ink-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 720,
                  "content": "That inspection determines the whole repair: which panels are repaired and which must be replaced, whether structure moved, which safety systems need calibration, and how the refinish has to be planned so the correction disappears.",
