                  "name": "D",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Colour is matched under controlled light and blended across panels so the correction disappears. Reassembly, calibration, and a documented quality-control review happen before anyone calls you.",
